---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="页面不存在">
  <section class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center px-4 py-20 text-center sm:px-6">
    <div class="surface-card w-full p-10 sm:p-14">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-line bg-paper-muted px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-accent dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-night-muted dark:text-accent-dark">
        ERROR // 404 NOT FOUND
      </span>
      <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-7xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-ink/15 sm:text-8xl dark:text-snow/15">
        404
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-serif text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">这一页走丢了</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft dark:text-snow-soft">
        你访问的页面不存在，或者已经被移动。也许它正在某个循环里等待下一次迭代。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-paper transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 dark:bg-snow dark:text-night"
        >
          回到首页
        </a>
        <a
          href="/search/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper-elev px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:border-accent/40 hover:text-ink dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-night-elev dark:text-snow-soft dark:hover:text-snow"
        >
          搜索文章
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
